311 0 obj
  << /ActualText (When it comes to defining dimensions in our design system\054 we primarily use \042rem\042 units instead of pixels\056 This choice is motivated by the need for a more flexible and scalable approach to design\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 312 0 R
     /Pg 308 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

